{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817940/extras/c8d164f03d474d8b278ee14e1e0fc815.avif?t=1751583920\" width=616 height=112 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817940/extras/cfd775ddae98aad1839f07d672f29f70.poster.avif?t=1751583920\" width=610 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817940/extras/cfd775ddae98aad1839f07d672f29f70.webm?t=1751583920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re 22 years old. GED graduate.<br>Delivering food on a motorbike to scrape by.<br>One rainy day, you get into an accident on the job\u2014<br>That\u2019s when you meet Juhee, and she offers you a job at her small, struggling caf\u00e9.<br>There, you encounter another girl who keeps catching your eye\u2014Latte.<br>As your life becomes entangled with these two women, can you finally break free from your loser past and experience true love?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817940/extras/163a6c69bb6b9bb4150667ed6d4f7624.avif?t=1751583920\" width=616 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817940/extras/67269e4f6add37b8db1acfe15dddef36.poster.avif?t=1751583920\" width=610 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817940/extras/67269e4f6add37b8db1acfe15dddef36.webm?t=1751583920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Latte Kwon</strong> (CV. Shin On-yu)<br>22 / Aspiring Actress<br><i>&quot;Wait, you\u2019re fantasizing about me just because I talked to you a few times?&quot;</i><br>Blunt and cold, yet somehow always close by.<br>Is she just using you? Or... is there something more behind her casual treatment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817940/extras/66cd4e50e9c422ec3e0b3494625103a8.poster.avif?t=1751583920\" width=610 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817940/extras/66cd4e50e9c422ec3e0b3494625103a8.webm?t=1751583920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Juhee Ban</strong> (CV. Lee Myeong-ho)<br>24 / Caf\u00e9 Owner<br><i>&quot;Let\u2019s meet again tomorrow\u2014with smiles.&quot;</i><br>Warm-hearted and thoughtful, she clings to her collapsing caf\u00e9 with a secret she won\u2019t share.<br>Haunted by past trauma, she struggles to trust men\u2014but maybe, just maybe, she\u2019s beginning to open her heart to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817940/extras/5cf2d5acb3462eb28e2f80073f4dee78.avif?t=1751583920\" width=616 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817940/extras/a3cadac88a29d4b8282de4cec2f517e4.poster.avif?t=1751583920\" width=610 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817940/extras/a3cadac88a29d4b8282de4cec2f517e4.webm?t=1751583920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Professional Voice Acting + High-Quality CG</strong><br>Over 20 full CG illustrations and fully voiced scenes bring the emotional story of both heroines vividly to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817940/extras/1d0a190089cf1ba541021348bae53e59.poster.avif?t=1751583920\" width=610 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817940/extras/1d0a190089cf1ba541021348bae53e59.webm?t=1751583920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817940/extras/1d0a190089cf1ba541021348bae53e59.mp4?t=1751583920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Life Management Mini-Game \u2013 Grow the 'Real' You</strong><br>Balance part-time caf\u00e9 work, self-improvement, and time with the heroines.<br>Shape your path through choices that determine the story\u2019s flow\u2014and its ending.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Getting started doesn't mean you're half-way done!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1817940/b5f836144d2b2aef9c845d2fd94251f0fad20369.jpg"},{"name":"The hero of all losers who made the fantasy come true!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1817940/e6d683ff4b9bff02fb817ad2112048fa34870776.jpg"},{"name":"Now you're only UGLY!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1817940/cdcb1af6beb0e6dd4b42c4c45f7c8c71de4e8212.jpg"},{"name":"Umm\u2026 the head size doesn't matter.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1817940/6243f4f